cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "O*NET Task→Ability Mapping Dataset"
abstract: >-
  A fine-grained mapping from 4,577 O*NET work tasks to the 52 O*NET human
  abilities each task requires, with a graded importance weight (1=mild,
  2=moderate, 3=critical) per (task, ability) pair. Built as the empirical
  foundation for the ATES (Agentic Task Exposure Score) framework and
  validated against human expert annotations (Cohen's kappa).
type: dataset
